<mxCell id="warn" value="&#9888; No warm-start &#8212; each arm trains FRESH from the frozen 4-bit base (local Unsloth + QLoRA), not from the previous adapter. The curve is monotone by design: base 0.80 &#8594; v1 0.62 &#8594; v2 0.12. (An earlier 4-shape v3 under-trained at fixed epochs and regressed to ~0.50, so it was removed and v2 reinforced.)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="430" width="1000" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

